Third-Party Notices
===================

This distribution bundles the following third-party software:

7-Zip (7za.exe / 7za-arm64.exe)
-------------------------------

- Component: `7za.exe` (x64) and `7za-arm64.exe` (arm64) — the standalone
  console version of 7-Zip, no external DLL required.
- Purpose: Extract the FreeCAD official Windows portable archive (`*.7z`,
  compressed with LZMA2) so users do not have to install 7-Zip manually.
  The reduced `7zr.exe` is NOT bundled because it only supports the LZMA
  codec and cannot extract FreeCAD's LZMA2 archive.
- Version: 26.06 (7-Zip "Extra" package)
- Source: https://github.com/ip7z/7zip/releases/tag/26.06 (7z2606-extra.7z)
- License: GNU LGPL (main license), with BSD 3-clause and BSD 2-clause
  portions. See the full text in `7za-LICENSE.txt` included in this package.
- The binaries are bundled unmodified.

FreeCAD
-------

FreeCAD itself is downloaded on demand from the official FreeCAD GitHub
releases (https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases) and is NOT bundled in
this package. FreeCAD is licensed under the GNU LGPL2+; see
https://wiki.freecad.org/Licence for details.
